nes action, puzzles, and time management. Your mission? Spot the highlighted toys, grab them quickly, and place them in the correct box while the factory conveyor belts keep moving.\n\n\ud83c\udfae Features:\n\nImmersive VR gameplay \u2013 feel like a real toy factory worker\n\nCollect toys like teddy bears, robots, planes, and more\n\nFast-paced factory action \u2013 pack toys before the clock runs out\n\nChallenging levels with increasing speed and difficulty\n\nColorful 3D toy factory environment designed for VR fun", "short_description": "Step into a toy factory in VR! Collect, pack, and rush to box toys before time runs out."}]}, "developer_name": "Devtitanx", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/devtitanx/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Devtitanx", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/devtitanx/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24253917684230178"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307451_1282793222712188_5863144523505531560_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ittl96kKxPMQ7kNvwHK8ui_&_nc_oc=AdrvT6DWhpQb_GSPDrxEZU6NAfET41gitpT3EwNIB9bnaoI5StVHiUSFkq3QbioaxdA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scon